  "scope": "Checkpoint 43 adds an exact scholarly quotation/context reference for Davidovitz 2 from held Kedar 2019 pp. 102–103 and 133, reducing the fixed campaign to 26 linked / 223 unlinked. Two provided native quote lines and the longer English opening quotation are separately captured and source-copy checked, retaining the source brace/spelling and different endpoints. This is a bounded quotation, not the complete original Ford edition, an original bowl photograph or independent clay reading. Kedar’s authorship/gender/handwriting claims remain source interpretations; the 2019 forthcoming/no-photo notice remains dated rather than a current absence finding. One existing shared Table 6 extract has eight count-column strings and ten conflated footnote/designation tokens repaired with the full original retained; other word/letter copying checks remain partial. Three complete source-page media records added on the existing appearance; no new object, appearance, capture or image derivative. Three exact documented NLI manifests were freshly attempted for NLI62, NLI190 and NLI7, each refused before retrieval under disallowed or unverifiable image-host robots permission. No image/manifest bytes obtained or old-designation bridges verified. A metadata-only inventory enumerates 204 exact unlinked NLI image leads; only three were newly attempted. Exact image/card requests sent to Miri; queue has ten resolved holdings and 16 requests. Four frozen histories extended with all earlier attempts retained, zero whole cases complete. Corpus now 2,013 texts; 1,286 edition rows (1,149 checked / 136 partial / one unreviewed), 2,021 media, 1,190 local images and 87 captures. Held PDFs remain 57 sources / 52 appearance-bearing / 1,237 appearances; historical native gaps remain 45. Goal active; no reset used.",
